# LFS rules that have to travel WITH the plugin.
#
# The repository root has its own .gitattributes, and everything here is already
# covered by it -- so inside the demo project this file changes nothing. It exists
# because the plugin is also published as a branch whose ROOT is this folder
# (git subtree split --prefix=Plugins/OSCulator), and a root .gitattributes is not
# part of that subtree. Without this, Icon128.png checks out on that branch as the
# pointer file rather than an image, and UE's plugin browser shows a broken icon.
#
# Anything added here that could ever live inside a plugin should also be listed in
# the root file, or the two disagree about the same path in the demo project.

*.png filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.jpg filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.uasset filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.umap filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# Source stays text, and normalises to LF in the repository.
*.h   text
*.cpp text
*.cs  text
*.uplugin text
*.md  text
